demy-id "q-34051" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+k[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}]-2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ k[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $k=-3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-34051/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "33586620-e110-5a37-874f-a92103c5e9fb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-34051"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-34600/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "d041a5c1-9af3-5c9d-b744-73203348e960" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-34600/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "ffa936cc-3905-5717-af0b-757c2dddf328" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-34600/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "cb861a6c-c34a-546e-aa36-23bcf6ddc3b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-34600/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7